there is a lot to buy in cyberpunk 2077  cars guns consumables and most  importantly  cybernetics most cybernetics offer  passive buffs however there are a few  that can fundamentally change the way  you play  here are some cybernetics that are worth  your hard earned eddies  don't forget to like and subscribe for  more cyberpunk tips  reinforce tendons aka double jump  there are two cybernetics that improve  these jump but there is  only one worth buying reinforced tendons  this gives v a double jump the other one  is a charge jump which is cool but  doesn't give you as much control  there are a handful of cool cybernetics  but i found this one to be the most  useful for my playstyle  not only does this make v more agile in  combat but it changes the way you  explore night city  there are even some areas of this city  where you can avoid the winding roads  altogether and leap from building the  building like the cyber ninja you've  always wanted to be reinforced tendons  also make infiltration gigs  far easier in most cases you can leap  onto the roof  open the skylight and complete the  objective without anyone ever  seeing you this particular upgrade is  common among ripper docks across night  city  the vendors in city center watson and  santo domingo  also rare variants of the reinforced  tendons upgrade which will set you back  45 000 eddies  gorilla arms aka more strength there are  four major arm cybernetics in cyberpunk  2077 but gorilla arms might be the most  useful  in and out of combat if you're  struggling with the janky boxing  missions i highly recommend picking up a  pair of these bad boys  your punches will be a lot deadlier and  no one will call you out on it so  technically it's not even cheating  i'll rip that tongue out according to  the in-game description  gorilla arms also let you rip open  specific doors and yank turrets from  their base  but you can perform both those actions  if your body attribute is high enough  even without gorilla arms  i'm not sure if that's a bug or an  oversight the developers missed  either way gorilla arms are worth your  eddies hell you could even make  all your money back fairly quickly by  betting high on the fistfights  if you want a low end version of the  gorilla arms you can find it from the  first stripper dock victor in watson  however if you want a legendary version  of the gorilla arms you can find it at  another ripper dock in the west side of  the city center  this variant is a massive upgrade  compared to the base versions but you'll  need to have 45 street cred and a lot of  eddies in order to purchase it  projectile launch system aka wrist  rockets  if you prefer spectacle over utility  then might i interest you in the  projectile launch system  this upgrade allows v to shoot rockets  out of their wrists  neat the major drawback of this ability  is that it replaces your grenades but  who needs grenades when you have a  rocket launcher with infinite ammo and  virtually no cooldown  built into your wrists in order to use  the projectile launch system you will  also need cyberware that enables  smartlink  you can find this arm upgrade from  different ripper docks around night city  including  victor and watson karensukov  aka bullet time  any solo with a focus on reflexes should  make this a  priority this nervous system cyberware  upgrade will slow down time by 90  for up to 3.5 seconds when blocking  aiming or attacking  during a dodge or slide maneuver the  karenzakov is useful for combat  encounters when you're facing multiple  foes or elite enemies and want to slow  down the pace to deal  extra damage if you want the best  karenzakov money can buy you'll need to  have 18 points in reflexes for your  character  once you meet that requirement you can  find this upgrade from the ripper dock  in santo domingo on the west end of the  district  this one in particular is a legendary  upgrade costing upwards of 35 000 eddies  so make sure you have enough money  saved up cyberdex aka a netrunner's best  friend  [Music]  if you're playing as a netrunner you  should always keep your eyes peeled for  better cyber decks  your cyber deck determines how much base  ram you have and how many quick hacks  you can equip  the cyber deck v starts with the game is  to put it bluntly  awful upgrading that stock cyber deck  should be a priority if you are just  starting the game and want to play as a  sneaky hacker  ripper docks all over night city sell  cyberdeck so stop by as many as possible  some are very expensive and require high  street cred so if you find one you like  make a mental note and return later on  there's a ton of cyberware in cyberpunk  2077  but these are the ones we found most  useful if there's one you like let us  know in the comments below and for more  cyberpunk 2077  subscribe to the channel  [Music]
 

